# A Timely Visit (sandoria 105): qm1's Prog operand of the pop arm and of the daytime arm. Stage 1, Prog 6 by GM, in a
# fresh zone (qm1's Wait 0: the wait is over), no NM up, NMKilled 0. At 12:00 (day): not UNABLE_TO_INVESTIGATE (Prog
# not 5): nil, DUG_UP. At 20:00 (night): no pop (Prog not 5): nil, DUG_UP.
char zone=JugnerForest pos=-309.382,-0.139,407.377 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Sandoria.ATimelyVisit accepted
charvar Quest[0][105]Prog 6
charvar Quest[0][105]Stage 1
login
trigger qm1                               # 12:00, day, Prog 6: the daytime arm's Prog operand fails; nil, DUG_UP
wait vana=8
trigger qm1                               # 20:00, night, wait over, no NM up, Prog 6: the pop arm's Prog operand fails; nil, DUG_UP
